From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 13:00:03 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] webservices: URL flags, message heap/reader/writer
 properties, WsCall properties

WsDecodeUrl honours WS_URL_FLAGS_ZERO_TERMINATE (zero terminated parts on the
heap), collapses "." and ".." path segments unless NO_PATH_COLLAPSE (on a copy,
never in the caller's string) and accepts ALLOW_HOST_WILDCARDS; WsEncodeUrl
honours ZERO_TERMINATE; unknown flags give E_INVALIDARG instead of E_NOTIMPL.
WsCreateMessage accepts the heap, XML reader and XML writer property structures,
keeps a private copy, applies them to the message heap, reader and writer, and
WsGetMessageProperty returns them. WsCall accepts CHECK_MUST_UNDERSTAND and
CALL_ID and rejects unknown call properties with E_INVALIDARG.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS

